+	 * The second layer is for overlays, which use the same vertex positions
+	 * as the base layer and thus easily lead to Z-fighting.
+	 * The overlay must stay at the true depth of its surface (pulling it towards
+	 * the camera makes it cover things resting on the node), so instead the base
